WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Private by construction. Your memory never leaves your computer.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.600
These are the controls that decide who, on your computer, may see what.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:14.215
Memories in a private topic never reach any assistant.

00:00:14.215 --> 00:00:17.415
You still see them.

00:00:17.415 --> 00:00:21.015
While paused, every assistant is told memory is paused, and nothing is read or written.

00:00:21.015 --> 00:00:30.410
Nothing is read or written.

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:34.010
Set a passcode, and locking stops your assistants and this window from using your memory until you enter it.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:38.010
MindToo. Private by construction. privateai.ltd/mindtoo/manual/privacy/

